{
  "slug": "windows-screenshot-paste",
  "name": "Windows Screenshot Paste",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Enables Ctrl+V screenshot pasting in Claude Code terminal on Windows. Installs an AutoHotkey v2 script that saves clipboard images as PNG files and types the file path into the terminal so Claude can read them directly.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `windows-screenshot-paste` (Use when a Windows user wants to paste screenshots directly into Claude Code terminal with Ctrl+V).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install windows-screenshot-paste@claude-community` from `sharooncs/claude-windows-screenshot-paste`.\n\nAuthor: @sharooncs",
